{"sections":[{"slug":"滤过","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"滤过"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤对象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"滤对象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本页讨论一般</span> $(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的滤对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/滤对象(1-范畴)","text":"$1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的滤对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">滤对象</span></strong> (filtered object) <span lang=\"zh\">是一个序列</span>\n$$\r\nX_\\bullet = (\\cdots\\to X_{-1}\\to X_0 \\to X_1\\to \\cdots),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即偏序集</span> $(\\mathbb Z,\\leq)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">另一种形式的滤对象是</span>\n$$\r\nX^\\bullet = (\\cdots \\to X_{1} \\to X_0 \\to X_{-1}\\to\\cdots),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\mathbb Z^{\\mathrm{op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">为了区分两种形式的滤对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可分别称之为上升滤对象和下降滤对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有时我们想象滤对象中的态射为单射</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">含入映射</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">但一般</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">尤其在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">语境中</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">不需要这个条件</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中一个对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">滤过</span></strong> (filtration) <span lang=\"zh\">是指一个滤对象</span> $X_\\bullet$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $X\\simeq\\operatorname{colim}X_\\bullet$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> CW <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">有滤过</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{sk}_0X \\to \\operatorname{sk}_1X \\to \\cdots.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">有自然的滤过</span>\n$$\r\n(U\\mathfrak g)_0 \\hookrightarrow (U\\mathfrak g)_1 \\hookrightarrow (U\\mathfrak g)_2\\hookrightarrow\\cdots.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>) $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/微分层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">微分算子层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal D_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">有自然的滤过</span>\n$$\r\n(\\mathcal D_X)_0 \\hookrightarrow (\\mathcal D_X)_1 \\hookrightarrow (\\mathcal D_X)_2 \\hookrightarrow\\cdots.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">典范滤过</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即链复形</span>\n$$\r\nX = (\\cdots\\to X_1\\to X_0 \\to X_{-1}\\to\\cdots)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">具有典范的上升滤过</span> (todo: <span lang=\"zh\">方向合理吗</span>)\n$$\r\n\\tau_{\\leq i} X= (\\cdots\\to 0 \\to \\operatorname{cofib}(X_{i+1}\\to X_i) \\to X_{i-1}\\to X_{i-2}\\to \\cdots).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">以及典范的下降滤过</span>\n$$\r\n\\tau_{\\geq i} X= (\\cdots\\to X_{i+2}\\to X_{i+1} \\to \\operatorname{fib}(X_{i}\\to X_{i-1}) \\to 0\\to \\cdots).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">带有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/t-结构","text":"t <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">且其心为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么对</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的滤对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">可构造</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/滤对象的谱序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤对象的谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关联分次代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关联分次对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦纤维塔","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦纤维塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}